-WFHjihz_3zzX1lfwU8tckDcuNm5ZDtFs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_NZFH_wKVZCTE5LnsPTtZzWxpj1Obj3ns2bF2Px8PRJQ&oe=6A37EB19"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "603762903542832", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982682_394634374507239_6439063808236322816_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7yJPnpk-3TwQ7kNvwGT8pX1&_nc_oc=Adq5ijboteRs6FkPhepgmpX4xINqAYLVUEfG2IyEHcTwqMO1fyR1ArpDBjtyXWLXWDY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9jH0H3hn86O1vLA-Ly1BTFvxXj24nk_IQxAvVD4hikOg&oe=6A37E072"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "/tmp/u0V51Y", "id": "2491391347618703", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974588_2491391350952036_5915712212038582272_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8u0oh5Wa8XUQ7kNvwGJfpyx&_nc_oc=AdquI4DSgZ_cRtzSTX2OwvSVuh8AWn6TuKAQ-wLSwSfp-9uBeq3hswkBNmy_LTQY0ws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8nytOR_zatFyX7sI0Nn95zVf7e6j2JFy5fbz4HoWM-Vw&oe=6A37E9CE"}, "display_name": "Kingspray Graffiti", "keywords": ["graffiti", "art", "spraypaint", "spray", "kingspray"], "long_description": "Creating amazing street art would be much more fun without the jail time! Kingspray is a battle-tested VR Graffiti Simulator, with realistic spray, colors, drips, metallics, and more!\n\nWorld-class artists have helped us create caps, realistic pressure and fading, metallics, wet/dry effects and real-world colors from Ironlak!\n\nWe have ten unique environments include a dusky city rooftop, an underpass next to the river, and an abandoned subway station! realistic paint surfaces like trucks, bricks, metals and various concretes!\n\nKingspray supports up to 4 players collaborating in Multiplayer! \n\nThis is just a fraction of the awesomeness you will find in Kingspray. Can't WAIT to see what you make!", "short_description": "Creating amazing street art would be much more f